<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan to issue T$10 bln NCDs on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-12-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Taiwan's central bank will issue T$10 billion in 44-day negotiable certificates of deposits (NCDs) this afternoon, a central bank official said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Bids will close at 3.00 p.m. (0700 GMT), the official added.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
